      "id": 145742,
      "name": "AlexxKay",
      "username": "AlexxKay",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-03T02:42:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you look at the keywords of all the GWVoss/Dok'Thorath cards, it seems \"Thorathian\" (at least when used AS a keyword) is not merely a racial identifier, but a professional one as well: it refers exclusively to members of the military (excluding enslaved military, which are \"Minion\"s).&nbsp; SS's bio only mentions her as a rebel, with no mention of ever having been part of the military, so it makes sense that she wouldn't have that keyword.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:23:33.493Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
