    {
      "id": 145750,
      "name": "LACK OF SUBTLETY",
      "username": "LACK_OF_SUBTLETY",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/bcef8e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-05T16:01:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My in-world explanation has been that while she is defintely of the Thoratian race, the game term \"Thoratian\" seems to apply to the Thoratians who are loyal to Voss, who see her as a traitor/outsider. Therefore, she is freely targeted and does not receive any of the benefits of being \"Thoratian\".</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:23:33.978Z",
