      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>My in-world explanation has been that while she is defintely of the Thoratian race, the game term &quot;Thoratian&quot; seems to apply to the Thoratians who are loyal to Voss, who see her as a traitor/outsider. Therefore, she is freely targeted and does not receive any of the benefits of being &quot;Thoratian&quot;.</p>",
